PHASE 2 — System Architecture Design
Architecture Flow
Camera
   ↓
Python Face Recognition Engine
   ↓
Attendance API
   ↓
PHP Backend
   ↓
MySQL Database
   ↓
Email/SMS Service
Facial Recognition Workflow
Capture Face
      ↓
Detect Face
      ↓
Compare Face Encodings
      ↓
Match Student
      ↓
Record Attendance
      ↓
Send Notification
